import AFTD.Prelude
import AFTD.Kb.Tcs.SimpleGraphIsHop

/-!
# simple_graph_leap_group

Topic: graphs   Node: 1f5b860b6c58

Provenance: formalization of a published result. Source: arXiv:2610.18463 (The group generated by a graph's derangements), Definition 2.1 (the leap group Λ₁(G)).

The leap group Λ₁(G) of a graph G: the subgroup of the symmetric group on the vertices generated by the hops of G.
-/

/-- The leap group `Λ₁(G)`: the subgroup of `Equiv.Perm V` generated by the hops of `G`. -/
def simple_graph_leap_group {V : Type*} (G : SimpleGraph V) : Subgroup (Equiv.Perm V) :=
  Subgroup.closure {h | simple_graph_is_hop G h}
